{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YSrQmPGvruWZA29oeWnZSR","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/you/ai-projects/video-generator-ai/courses/agent-skills-for-testers/lessons/10-skills-that-hand-off/material/copy-chain/bugs/D-1-csv-reimport-duplicates/report.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"010b2bdb-848d-43fc-a7b3-734432b4e874","uuid":"dcb61268-1a2f-413a-93b4-205b1ef7a242","timestamp":"2026-11-21T22:37:10.747Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/Users/you/ai-projects/video-generator-ai/courses/agent-skills-for-testers/lessons/10-skills-that-hand-off/material/copy-chain/bugs/D-1-csv-reimport-duplicates/report.md","oldString":"Status: confirmed","newString":"Status: still broken","originalFile":"# D-1: Importing the same CSV twice stores every night twice\n\nStatus: confirmed\nTracker: duplicate of NJ-12 (open)\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n1. Start with an empty diary.\n2. Import a diary CSV (for example `data/sample_nights.csv`) via `POST /import`.\n3. Import the same file again.\n\n## Expected\nNights already in the diary are not added again. The diary has one entry per night.\n\n## Actual\nEvery night is stored a second time. A 2-night file gives 4 nights after two imports.\nThe cause is in `src/nightjar/diary.py`. `add_nights` calls `add_night` for every\nparsed row, and the `nights` table has no uniqueness constraint or duplicate check.\n`web.py` `import_csv` then reports the full count as imported.\n\n## Reproducibility\n3 of 3 runs\n\n## Repro\n`uv run python bugs/D-1-csv-reimport-duplicates/repro.py`\n\nExit 1 means the defect is present (prints the night count it saw). Exit 0 means it is fixed.\n\nNote: the tracker seed data contains a ticket that appears to describe this same defect\n(the \"uploaded it again by mistake\" report). `/file-bug` should search for it first and\nrecord \"duplicate of NJ-n\" if it is still open.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" # D-1: Importing the same CSV twice stores every night twice"," ","-Status: confirmed","+Status: still broken"," Tracker: duplicate of NJ-12 (open)"," "," ## Steps to reproduce"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YSrQmPGvruWZA29oeWnZSR","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
